FEEDBACK COMPONENTS
Answer Feedback Variants
Correct Answer Toast
Incorrect Answer Toast
Streak Counter
XP Indicator
Green bar slides up from bottom. Checkmark icon + varied praise text. Auto-dismisses after 1.5s. Contains "Continue" button. Shows earned XP.
Amber bar slides up. Shows correct answer prominently. Brief explanation of why. "Got it" button to proceed. No punitive language.
Flame icon with counter. Scales up on increment (spring animation). Milestone celebrations at 3, 5, 7, 10. Persistent in session header.
Floating "+10 XP" that rises and fades. Different colors for different sources. Accumulates visually in session progress bar.
