CONTEXT — ENGLISH LEARNING APP
JULY 2026
Content Design System
The rules governing every word, sentence, instruction, and feedback message in the app — because content is the product.
PHASE 14
Content Is the Interface
In a language learning app, content isn't supplementary — it IS the product. The vocabulary list, the exercise prompts, the feedback messages, the story text — all of it must follow consistent rules to create a coherent learning experience.
VOICE & TONE
Content Voice Guidelines
Instructions
Feedback — Correct
Feedback — Incorrect
Encouragement
Clear, imperative, concise. "Tap the correct word" not "Please select the word that you think is correct." Use the simplest language the learner can understand.
Varied celebrations. Rotate between "Perfect!", "Nice one!", "You got it!", "Exactly right!" Avoid repetition within the same session.
Gentle, specific, forward-looking. "Almost! The word is 'beautiful' — you spelled it 'beautifull'." Never just "Wrong." Always show the right answer.
Earned, not constant. "You've learned 50 new words this week!" is better than "Great job!" after every answer. Celebration inflation kills motivation.
CONTENT RULES
Content Production Guidelines
Vocabulary Selection
Sentence Construction
Cultural Sensitivity
Translation Quality
Words chosen by frequency (most common first), concreteness (visual-friendly first), and thematic relevance (world-appropriate). No random word lists.
Example sentences use only previously learned vocabulary + the target word. No sentence should require understanding words the learner hasn't seen.
All content reviewed for cultural neutrality. No assumptions about family structure, diet, religion, or lifestyle. Globally inclusive examples.
Translations are contextual, not literal. "How are you?" translates to the natural equivalent, not word-by-word. Native speaker reviewed.
DELIVERABLES
Content System Outputs
String Library
Exercise Templates
Editorial Guidelines
Every UI string cataloged with: key, English value, context note, character limit, pluralization rules. Translation-ready from day one.
Templates for each exercise type with variable slots. Enables AI-generated content that follows the same quality rules as hand-crafted content.
Complete content creation guide for future content producers. Ensures consistency even as the team grows beyond the founding designer.

